WEBVTT

00:09:28.939 --> 00:09:31.900
use what I like to call
the Mad Libs approach.

00:09:32.693 --> 00:09:35.237
Maybe you played Mad Libs
in middle school.

00:09:35.613 --> 00:09:37.531
Maybe you still play Mad Libs.

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:40.576
It’s that fun, 
fill-in-the-blank word game.

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:45.331
So with a little bit of Mad Libs style,
we get this easy-to-use

00:09:45.372 --> 00:09:47.458
Gracenotes road map.

00:09:48.459 --> 00:09:51.503
"You are the only person I know who ..."

00:09:53.839 --> 00:09:56.467
"I always laugh when I think about ..."

00:09:57.968 --> 00:10:00.220
"You will leave a legacy around ..."